### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api

### 1. GET revenue report (Initial state)
GET {{baseUrl}}/gyms/revenue

### 2. GET all members (Initial state)
GET {{baseUrl}}/members

### 3. PATCH cancel Member 5 membership
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/members/{{member_id_5}}/cancel
Content-Type: application/json

### 4. GET revenue report (After cancellation)
GET {{baseUrl}}/gyms/revenue

### 5. GET all members (After cancellation)
GET {{baseUrl}}/members